    "description": "<p><i>Homebrew Prestige Class (tovec.wikidot.com/episode-vii)</i></p><p>Consolidates the Improviser, Military Engineer, Outlaw, and Saboteur prestige classes. Grants access to the Improviser, Military Engineer, Misfortune, Outlaw, Outlaw Tech, Procurement, Sabotage, Slicer, and Turret talent trees.</p><p>Gains Destructive (Saboteur), Field-Created Weapon, Fugitive, and No Tools Required at 1st level.</p>",
